Package: glyospalettes
Title: Color Palettes Inspired by Glyos Colorways
Version: 0.2.2
Authors@R: 
    person("Brian", "Maitner", , "bmaitner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Color palettes based on the named colorways of the Glyos toy
    system: Onell Design's Glyos System Series and the Glyos-compatible lines
    from partner companies such as TheGodBeast, Spy Monkey Creations, Toyfinity
    and the Four Horsemen. Includes ggplot2 colour and fill scales for discrete
    and continuous data, metadata linking each palette to its company and
    product line, and helpers to shortlist palettes that suit categorical,
    colour-blind-safe, sequential or diverging use. Hex values are
    approximations curated from product photography; glyospalettes is a fan project
    and is not affiliated with or endorsed by any of the companies.
